    "name": "Itibari POS - Complete Sales Module API Collection (Filters, Stats, Search, POS Terminal & Backend Defect Catalog)",
    "_postman_id": "itibari-sales-filters-20261013",
    "description": "Comprehensive Postman collection for frontend and backend engineers covering the entire Itibari Sales module:\n1. Commercial Invoicing (/sales/invoice-sales) - Invoices, Proformas, Quotations, live KPI stats, status filters, search, and export route collisions.\n2. Retail POS Terminal Sales History (/pos) - Cash & Credit orders, status filters (UPPERCASE vs Title-case bug), date range filters, summary KPIs, cashier shift stats, and export failure.\n3. POS Register Checkout & Customer Onboarding (/pos) - Product pricing catalog, category filters, customer onboarding, order creation, cash payment, and receipt generation.\n4. POS Returns Management (/pos) - Return reasons configuration, returns audit log, and return note processing.\n5. Loyalty Program & Discount Policies (/pos-settings) - Tier configuration and storewide discount rules.\n6. User Profile & Auth Gateway (/pos/users) - Working replacement for broken /staff/profile endpoint.\n\nPre-configured with DEV environment variables ({{baseUrl}} and valid JWT {{bearerToken}}).",
